# Only backend/ and scripts/ are ever COPY'd into an image (see docker/*.Dockerfile).
# This file keeps everything else (and anything sensitive that shouldn't ride
# along even inside backend/) out of the build context (AppSec review High:
# CWE-538 — .gitignore is NOT respected by `docker build`, only this file is).

# Everything not explicitly needed.
*
!backend/
!scripts/

# ...but never secrets, caches, or local artifacts, even inside those trees.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.json
!backend/pyproject.toml
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
!backend/cyclotorsion/secrets.py
**/*.pem
**/*.key
